      "content": "SP 80 NE               WENDOVER          ELLESBOROUGH ROAD 8/228                                    Barn to N.N. west of Wellwick                                          Manor. 25/10/51 GV                                       II Barn at right angles to previous item. C18 altered. Timber framed on brick plinth with old brick infilling to outer bays on S. side, centre bays filled with modern brickwork, partly weatherboarded. Gables and N. side weatherboarded, gabled cart entry. Tiled roof. Interior of 5 bays, with old wall posts but C19 roof timbers. Weatherboarded and tiled lean-to at E. end. Included for group value. RCHM I p.311 MON. 49. Listing NGR: SP8532607904"
    }
